sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as Match API
  participant Privacy as Authorization/DTO policy
  participant DB as MySQL
  Student->>UI: Open Matches
  activate UI
  UI->>API: GET /api/v1/matches
  activate API
  API->>Privacy: Require authenticated active student
  activate Privacy
  Privacy-->>API: Authorized
  deactivate Privacy
  API->>DB: Read courses, preferences, availability
  activate DB
  DB-->>API: Candidate data
  deactivate DB
  API->>API: Rank compatible candidates
  API->>Privacy: Map to safe public match DTOs
  activate Privacy
  Privacy-->>API: No email or detailed availability
  deactivate Privacy
  API-->>UI: Explanations and safe match cards
  deactivate API
  UI-->>Student: Display results
  deactivate UI
